The BEVFormer-based streaming layers have been adapted into the standalone
PyTorch Remake implementation. This release further removes training entry
points, loss and assignment code, and renames public components to the
DualTopo paper terminology. Learned tensor values are preserved.

Deformable attention calls the separately installed Hugging Face
Transformers implementation. Torchvision supplies ResNet-50 and image
rotation operations. Their packages retain their own license notices.

OpenLane-V2 images and annotations are not distributed here and remain
subject to the dataset's own terms.
